---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund & Cancellation Policy (Owner Draft) — ExamPath Lab"
  description="Transparent refund and cancellation rules for ExamPath Lab digital study packs."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Legal' },
    { label: 'Refund Policy' }
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-900 mb-8">
      <strong>Owner-Review Working Draft:</strong> Pilot phase refund policy for digital learning materials.
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl text-[#172633] mb-6">
      Refund & Cancellation Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-sm text-[#536471] space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">1. Free Core Library</h2>
        <p>All core foundation guides, common challenge cheat-sheets, and interactive practice flashcards hosted on ExamPath Lab are completely free of charge. No refund terms apply to free public materials.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">2. Digital Pilot Study Packs</h2>
        <p>Because digital learning materials are irrevocable once delivered, refunds are evaluated based on factual discrepancies. If a verified pilot weekly drop contains demonstrated mathematical errors, corrupt files, or substantial deviations from the stated syllabus preview, you are entitled to a full refund if requested within 48 hours of purchase verification.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-[#172633]">3. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p>To request a refund during the pilot phase, send an email to <code>editorial@exampathlab.com</code> with your transaction reference number, the date of order, and a brief description of the issue. Verified refund requests are processed back to the original source of payment within 3 to 5 business days.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
